    </p> <ul data-v-0a492178=""><li data-v-0a492178=""><a href="/liveapi/guides/v4/" data-v-0a492178="">Odds API docs</a></li> <li data-v-0a492178=""><a href="/liveapi/guides/v4/samples.html" data-v-0a492178="">Python and NodeJS code samples</a></li></ul> <p data-v-0a492178="">
        To bring bookmaker odds into your website with a simple HTML tag, and to monetize with bookmaker affiliate links, 
